  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the performance of the rural health sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide electricity from solar power to 120 rural health posts and access to warm water for the maternity facilities of these health posts to cover the need of 1.6 million inhabitants. After electrification of the health posts the MoH will supply electronic medical appliances.</narrative>
  </description>
